{"id":"7cc0612790","t":"She is the Daughter of the Villainess in a Trashy Melodrama","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover-4-193x278.jpeg","n":16,"l":16,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama"},"u":1795035092583,"desc":"بعد أن تتجسّد من جديد داخل روايةٍ مبالغٍ فيها هي المفضّلة لدى أختها الصغرى، تجد إيدل نفسها تؤدّي دورَ شرّيرةٍ غادرةٍ مقدَّرٍ لها أن تخون الدوقَ الذي ربّاها. ولأنها تعلم المصيرَ المأساويّ الذي ينتظرها، تقرّر أن تتصرّف كشرّيرةٍ ثانويّة وتفرّ قبل أن تسوء الأمور. غير أنّ خططها تبدأ بالانهيار حين تجد نفسها، على غير توقّع، مصمّمةً على حماية أختها الصغرى، فيما تجعل شخصيّاتُ الرواية الفوضويّة وتقلّباتُها العبثيّة الهروبَ أصعبَ بكثيرٍ ممّا كانت تتوقّع.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["خيال","دراما","رومانسى","شوجو","فانتازا","كومديا"],"src":{"ml":"she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama|/manga/she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama/1/"},"2":{"ml":"she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama|/manga/she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama/2/"},"3":{"ml":"she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama|/manga/she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama/3/"},"4":{"ml":"she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama|/manga/she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama/4/"},"5":{"ml":"she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama|/manga/she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama/5/"},"6":{"ml":"she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama|/manga/she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama/6/"},"7":{"ml":"she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama|/manga/she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama/7/"},"8":{"ml":"she-is-the-daughter-of-the-villainess-in-a-trashy-melodrama|/manga/she-is-the-daughter-of-t